The theme store's `secondary` is the tonal button's fill, and Material draws a
selected tab's label in its own `secondary`. One key cannot be both a quiet
fill and a label that has to read on the bar, so Material's is the surface's
text colour, and the store's stays the button's.

--- a/vendor/nativephp/mobile-ui/resources/android/NativeUITheme.kt
+++ b/vendor/nativephp/mobile-ui/resources/android/NativeUITheme.kt
@@ -243,3 +243,3 @@
-        secondary        = secondary,
-        onSecondary      = onSecondary,
+        secondary        = onSurface,
+        onSecondary      = surface,
         tertiary         = accent,
